OL,3,GNEWSAThe 800-year history of the Mersey
OL,4,Aferries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the first new Mersey Ferry to be
OL,7,Fbuilt in 60 years takes its first
OL,8,Fpublic cruise we look at how river
OL,9,Fcrossings have linked Liverpool and
OL,10,FWirral for more than 800 years.
OL,12,FThe new #26m Royal Daffodil, built by
OL,13,FWirral shipbuilder Cammell Laird, was
OL,14,Fofficially launched on Tuesday after a
OL,15,Fnaming ceremony in Liverpool.
OL,17,FIt replaces the decommissioned Royal
OL,18,FIris of the Mersey and joins the
OL,19,FSnowdrop, also known as the Dazzle
OL,20,FFerry due to its vibrant design.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
